title: 'CI Fixes: Format TOML files and regenerate umbrella crate'
doc:
- audience: [Runtime Dev, Node Dev]
  description: |-
    This PR resolves critical CI failures in the checks-quick workflow by:
    - Formatting 507 TOML files with taplo to pass check-toml-format
    - Regenerating umbrella crate with proper feature propagation (734 issues fixed)
    - Applying cargo fmt to ensure correct code formatting

    All quick-checks workflow jobs now pass successfully.
crates: []
